    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KIRU KIRU KIRU is a fast-paced 2D arena shooter inspired by DOOM and ULTRAKILL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In particular, it is a bloody, ultra-fast slasher about crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many enemies actively attack and you need to maneuver between them to prevent them from attacking, restore yourself with their blood, dodge their attacks and prioritize your targets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Redirecting attacks to opponents with melee hit:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rip and cut</i> mutants, robots, ghosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride along the walls and ceiling, dash through the enemies, dodge their attacks and make their <u>blood</u> flow. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KIRU KIRU KIRU is a fast-paced 2D arena shooter inspired by DOOM and ULTRAKILL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In particular, it is a bloody, ultra-fast slasher about crowd control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many enemies actively attack and you need to maneuver between them to prevent them from attacking, restore yourself with their blood, dodge their attacks and prioritize your targets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/f9a1b079318c0de23fd0100871e31ab6.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/46baa0e3c440b271eec7fcdbfe9ccbad.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Redirecting attacks to opponents with melee hit:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.poster.avif?t=1755011437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.webm?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196030/extras/60de388731a6e62e84afbaa098246a5d.mp4?t=1755011437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rip and cut</i> mutants, robots, ghosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride along the walls and ceiling, dash through the enemies, dodge their attacks and make their <u>blood</u> flow. </p>",
